      info: "Give this container a gradient, cascaded to every shape beneath it.\n\nLike the other style methods on SceneNode this sets the container's OWN style and does not touch its children; the cascade happens lazily in {@link effectiveStyle}, so a shape that sets its own gradient still wins.\n\nSee {@link Curve.colorGradient} for the accepted argument forms.",
